{"id":"linear_kernel","title":"Linear inner-product kernel","family":"kernel","definition":"reference","intro_en":"The linear kernel adds products of corresponding coordinates. Its animation shows which indices contribute positively or negatively before adding them into the inner product. It preserves amplitude and offset effects unless preprocessing removes them, and its scale grows with vector energy.","intro_zh":"线性核将对应坐标的乘积相加。动图先展示各位置的正负贡献，再累加成内积。若预处理没有消除幅度与偏移，它们会保留在结果中；分数量级随向量能量变化。","steps_en":["Use the same aligned coordinate system for both vectors.","Compute and sum the coordinatewise contributions shown in the plot.","Apply the specified scalar kernel transformation to that complete sum.","Read the pair score; kernel magnitude is not a calibrated similarity probability."],"steps_zh":["对两个向量使用同一个已对齐坐标系。","计算图示逐坐标贡献并求和。","对完整求和结果施加指定的标量核变换。","读取成对分数；核函数量级不是校准后的相似概率。"],"formula":"K(x,y)=sum_i x_i*y_i","caveats_en":["An inner product is not bounded by one and can be negative; normalization would produce a different kernel or cosine score.","No local time warping is performed by this aligned-vector construction."],"caveats_zh":["内积没有一的上界，也可以为负；归一化会产生不同的核或余弦分数。","此已对齐向量构造不执行局部时间扭曲。"],"sources":[{"label":"scikit-learn: pairwise kernels and their formulas","url":"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/metrics.html"}],"x":[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.5,1.2,0.3,-0.4,-0.1],"y":[0.1,0.3,0.5,1.2,2.6,3.1,2.3,1.1,0.2,-0.3],"input_label":"Deterministic illustrative arrays; no benchmark data","parameters":{"preprocessing":"none"},"result":{"label":"kernel score","value":22.68,"detail":"The explicit definition and parameters shown on this card."},"frames":[{"phase":0,"caption":"Compute the indicated contribution at each aligned index","panel":{"kind":"bars","title":"Coordinate products x_i*y_i","a":[0.020000000000000004,0.12],"labels":["1","2"],"marker":1,"a_label":"contribution"},"value":0.14,"value_label":"partial sum"},{"phase":0,"caption":"Compute the indicated contribution a